OL,3,ANHS staff may have breached tiger
OL,4,Aattack victim's medical records
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedical records belonging to a man
OL,7,Fkilled by a tiger at Yorkshire Wildlife
OL,8,FPark may have been accessed "without a
OL,9,Flegitimate reason" by staff at
OL,10,FYorkshire Ambulance Service, a
OL,11,Fspokesperson has said.
OL,13,FWilliam Chapman, 24, was mauled to
OL,14,Fdeath at the park near Doncaster on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FIn a statement, the trust said
OL,18,Ffollowing Chapman's death it had
OL,19,Fidentified two possible incidents of
OL,20,Fstaff "accessing or attempting to
OL,21,Faccess incident/medical information"
OL,22,Fabout the case.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
